      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/salem_nebraska",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Its settlement followed the Kansas‑Nebraska Act of 1854, which opened the Nebraska Territory to white pioneers.",
